<title>HONG KONG: China Res Beijing Land debuts at HK$3.20.</title>
<headline>China Res Beijing Land debuts at HK$3.20.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of China Resources Beijing Land Ltd, the spinoff China property arm of China Resources Enterprise Ltd, made their trading debut at HK$3.20, compared with their issue price of HK$2.36 per share.  </p>
<p>China Resouces Beijing Land offered 300 million shares of which 15 percent was for public subscription in Hong Kong and 85 percent for placement to professioanl and institutional investors.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong flotation of shares was 125.7 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The sole material asset of China Resources Beijing Land is its 62.5 percent equity interest in Beijing Huayuan Property Co Ltd, a land development and investment company in Beijing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
